    ji "我不是在躲他，但还是很难受。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1539
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_6f6e1739:

    # isa "Don't think too much about it. Focus on having a fun time with your friends instead."
    isa "别想太多，多想想怎么和朋友们玩得开心点。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1542
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_63fa2508:

    # ji "Hm... Yes and no. I get to spend the night with my friends, which I'll enjoy, but I'm not sure about what kind of party it will be."
    ji "嗯……既期待又不期待。能和朋友们一起过这个晚上，我当然很开心，但不知道那会是怎样的派对。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1544
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_46a3e9f5:

    # isa "Well, you know [name] by now. It could be anything between heaven and hell."
    isa "你现在也算了解[name]了。那场派对可能像天堂，也可能像地狱。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1546
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_1890c940:

    # ji "Yeah... I feel a bit weird about that."
    ji "嗯……关于这个我有点不太自在。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1547
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_d475cc07:

    # ji "He didn't invite me. Josy did."
    ji "不是他邀请的我，是Josy。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1549
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_2c00729d:

    # isa "I see."
    isa "我明白。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1552
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_1e754ead:

    # ji "I hope he's ok with it, but I'm not sure... Do you think I should have asked him first?"
    ji "我希望他能接受，但我不确定……你觉得我应该先问他一声吗？"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1553
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_b86aba79:

    # ji "I thought maybe he would have invited me, so now I don't know what to make of it."
    ji "我原以为他也许会邀请我，所以现在真不知道该怎么理解这件事。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1556
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_8b2dcb2c:

    # ji "I don't know what to make of it, really."
    ji "我真的不知道该怎么想这件事。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1558
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_876d57de:

    # isa "Maybe he didn't think you'd want to go. I mean, I'm kind of surprised you're going myself."
    isa "也许他以为你不想去。说真的，连我都很意外你会参加。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1560
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_5f2a5e31:

    # ji "True. But Bianca and Olivia got all excited when I said I was invited."
    ji "也是。不过Bianca和Olivia听说我受邀后，都兴奋得不得了。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1561
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_31b09724:

    # ji "It turns out they've wanted to go to their parties for a while to see what they're like."
    ji "原来她们早就想参加DIK的派对，看看究竟是什么样子。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1563
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_a2de0072:

    # isa "Is peer pressure making you go?"
    isa "你是因为同伴压力才去的吗？"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1565
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_5474a2bb:

    # ji "No, it's not like that. It also gives me a perfect reason to not attend High Society Halloween."
    ji "不，不是那样。而且这样我就有了不参加上流社会万圣节晚会的绝佳理由。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1567
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_5a50d131:

    # isa "It will be good for you, Jill."
    isa "这对你有好处，Jill。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1568
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_3547f21d:

    # isa "I frankly think you should have been going to these parties ages ago."
    isa "坦白说，你早就该参加这种派对了。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1570
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_2d727dbb:

    # ji "Really? Ages ago?"
    ji "真的？早就该去？"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1572
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_48b4e301:

    # isa "You get my point."
    isa "你明白我的意思。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1574
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_a3729502:

    # ji "Do you wanna come with us?"
    ji "你愿意和我们一起去吗？"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1576
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_ce29c52c:

    # isa "It's kind of late for that question. I don't have anything to wear, and besides, I'd still say no if I had."
    isa "你现在才问，未免太晚了。我没有合适的衣服，而且就算有，我还是会拒绝。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1577
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_477ae131:

    # isa "Back in college, I wouldn't have liked it if my teachers had come to our parties."
    isa "大学时候，要是老师来我们聚会，我肯定不会喜欢。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1582
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_71f6ec36:

    # ji "Not even if they came to enjoy themselves?"
    ji "就算他们来是为了玩乐？"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1584
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_6ec749ee:

    # isa "No. Definitely not. That'd have been even worse."
    isa "不。绝对不行。那情况会更糟。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1585
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_a56d96d8:

    # isa "No one wants to dance or get drunk with their teacher."
    isa "没人想和老师跳舞或者喝醉。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1590
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_f0bfcd66:

    # ji "Maybe that depends on the teacher?"
    ji "也许这得看是哪个老师？"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1592
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_1c971285:

    # isa "Well, perhaps..."
    isa "嗯，也许吧..."

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1597
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_3041c1f4:

    # ji "Even so, you should stop by before you head back home. I'll meet you outside, and I can show you my costume."
    ji "即便如此，你回家前也该顺路来一下。我会在外面等你，让你看看我的服装。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1599
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_29779bb2:

    # ji "You'll either love it or hate it."
    ji "你要么会爱死它，要么会讨厌死它。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1602
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_3e6c748d:

    # isa "I'll do that. Have a nice evening and try not to fall."
    isa "我会过去的。今晚玩得开心，尽量别摔倒。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1604
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_944a51e3:

    # isa "I'll do that. Have a nice evening."
    isa "我会的。祝你晚上愉快。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1610
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_681da456:

    # ji "I'll try! Talk later."
    ji "我会的！回头聊。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1612
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_bella_library_label_1b42b8b6:

    # ji "Talk later."
    ji "回头聊。"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1619
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_sword_event_label_872ffd16:

    # mc "(Oh, yeah! That's where I put it.)"
    mc "（哦，对！原来我把它放在这里了。）"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1621
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_sword_event_label_72c544ac:

    # mc "(It's a pretty flimsy sword.)"
    mc "（这把剑做得还挺不结实。）"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:1622
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_sword_event_label_080e68d5:

    # mc "(But my costume is complete.)"
    mc "（不过这样我的服装就齐全了。）"

# freeroam\episode9\ep9_freeroam_ph1_events.rpy:434
translate schinese ep9_diks_ph1_sally_event_label_68dbccc0_1:

    # mc "A tequila drink for Karen is coming up..." nointeract
    mc "给Karen的龙舌兰饮料马上就来……" nointeract
